And the engineer is very much driving that.

914
00:45:56,570 --> 00:45:59,410
PM会被拉进来，在需要时提供建议
The PM will get looped in and they'll advise if needed.

915
00:45:59,890 --> 00:46:02,670
如果事情严重偏离轨道
And if something is wildly going off track,

916
