我上周在日本住酒店时，睡在那家酒店里，我真的非常喜欢自己用的那个枕头
I was in Japan last week and I was sleeping in this hotel and I actually really loved the pillow that I had in this hotel.

2237
01:48:56,590 --> 01:48:57,170
这事儿特别随机
It was very random.

2238
01:48:57,330 --> 01:49:02,270
我有时候会脖子和上斜方肌疼 对自己的
At times I had like neck and upper trap pain and sometimes I've been frustrated with my

2239
01:49:02,270 --> 01:49:04,250
枕头也挺不满意 因为我有时候仰睡
pillow because I sometimes sleep facing up,

2240
01:49:04,310 --> 01:49:07,110
有时候侧睡 枕头高度总是不太合适
sometimes sideways and like the height's not quite right.

2241
01:49:07,230 --> 01:49:09,650
