And I was like, this pillow is just great.

2242
01:49:09,750 --> 01:49:13,470
基本上这个枕头里面是装满了小颗粒
And basically this pillow is like it kind of it's full of beads.

2243
01:49:13,470 --> 01:49:19,330
所以你在睡觉的时候可以很自然地调整枕头的高度
And so you can like naturally shift the height of the pillow while you're sleeping,

2244
01:49:19,470 --> 01:49:21,410
甚至是无意识地 不用刻意去想
like even like unconsciously without thinking.

2245
