01:49:48,290 --> 01:49:50,470
Main one I'd say is just, she'll be right.
我最常说的一句大概是 “she'll be right”

2256
01:49:50,730 --> 01:49:52,690
这是澳洲人特别常说的一句话
This is a very common Aussie saying.

2257
01:49:52,770 --> 01:49:53,970
字面意思就是 “一切都会好的”
It's like, she will be right.

2258
01:49:54,050 --> 01:49:58,350
“She'll be right” 是澳洲人在面对困难或棘手情况时常说的一句话
She'll be right. It's a common Aussie saying when we're faced with like a tough or difficult situation.

2259
01:49:59,210 --> 01:50:03,210
你有点是在淡化事情的严重性 好像在说 没事儿 一切都会好的
You're kind of like dismissing the severity of it in a way by saying like, it'll be fine.

2260
01:50:03,430 --> 01:50:07,010
我觉得这是一个特别好的比喻
And I think that that's just like such a good metaphor.

2261
01:50:07,330 --> 01:50:10,050
在很多很多情况下 这都是一个特别好用的心态技巧
It's such a good like tactic in many, many cases.

2262
01:50:10,610 --> 01:50:12,190
另外一句是
And then I think the other one is just like,

2263
01:50:12,550 --> 01:50:14,450
人生有时候 你就是得豁出去干一把
sometimes in life, you just have to go for it.

2264
01:50:14,830 --> 01:50:17,950
这是一个叫Eros Resmini的人常说的话
And that is something that this guy Eros Resmini,

2265
01:50:18,090 --> 01:50:19,790
他是Discord的首席营销官
who is the CMO of Discord,

2266
01:50:20,030 --> 01:50:22,530
在我做创业者 / 创始人的时候 他是我非常亲近的顾问
he was a very close advisor to me as a founder.

2267
01:50:22,630 --> 01:50:23,670
他经常在这方面鼓励我
He would push me on this.

2268
01:50:23,710 --> 01:50:25,590
他经常对我说的就是
And that was something that he would often say is just like,

2269
01:50:25,650 --> 01:50:26,330
别想太多 就去干
just go for it.

2270
01:50:26,330 --> 01:50:27,930
我觉得这句话
And I think that that's,

2271
01:50:28,030 --> 01:50:30,890
非常有帮助 因为你完全可以一直坐在那里想
it's a very helpful thing of you can sit there thinking,

2272
01:50:31,130 --> 01:50:31,830
我该不该做 该不该试
should I do this, should I not?

2273
01:50:31,910 --> 01:50:32,770
但人生有时候
And sometimes in life,

2274
01:50:32,810 --> 01:50:33,730
你就是得上 就是得去做
you just have to go for it.

2275
01:50:34,130 --> 01:50:35,370
我特别喜欢这两句搭在一起
I love the combo of those two.

2276
01:50:36,290 --> 01:50:38,570
有时候就是大胆去做 然后一切都会好的
Just sometimes just go for it and she'll be right.

